00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.383
how to monetize my skill.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.720
- What comes through
your mind on selling it?

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.670
Like how do you think about selling it?

00:08:37.563 --> 00:08:41.920
- I would love to be on social media

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:44.173
and just produce content that way.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:47.390
- And make money through ads on YouTube,

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:50.480
or brand deals or self-subscriptions

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:53.003
or sell merchandise or start a school?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.263
- I mean, the first thing

00:08:57.263 --> 00:09:00.393
that comes to my mind
is sponsorships, ads.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.740
I have started a school.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:08.430
I'm actually working at a
grocery store right now,

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:09.880
like 40 hours in the morning.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:11.943
- Thank you for being
in those front lines.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.800
Tanner, I mean, you could start

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:17.660
making YouTube videos
and start getting ads

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.343
from the YouTube videos tomorrow.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:23.680
You know when somebody comes
to you and they've never

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:26.116
done martial arts, and they're
never really worked out

00:09:26.116 --> 00:09:29.030
and they're like "Hey, I
wanna be a black belt."

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:29.930
- Mm-hmm (laughs).

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:32.503
- Right?

00:09:32.503 --> 00:09:34.080
And even the fact that
you just laughed that way,

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.570
what goes through your mind immediately

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:36.870
because you know your craft so well

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.780
