00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:41.590
You know people say to you like,

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:43.107
they mean it too, they roll up and

00:09:43.107 --> 00:09:45.010
"Dude, I wanna be a black belt."

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:46.670
And you're like awesome, are you ready

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:48.301
