00:09:48.301 --> 00:09:50.210
- (laughs) yep.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.720
- That's kind of what
you're saying right now

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:54.253
about monetizing through
being an influencer.

00:09:56.159 --> 00:09:58.023
Like, it's fuckin' work.

00:09:59.673 --> 00:10:00.506
- You just start now, and--
- Now, you may have

00:10:00.506 --> 00:10:02.600
natural talents, yeah exactly.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.710
You know this, everybody wants a shortcut

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:05.907
in their martial arts, like "Yo, bro,

00:10:05.907 --> 00:10:07.581
"can't I just watch a bunch of videos?"

00:10:07.581 --> 00:10:08.583
Right?

00:10:09.486 --> 00:10:11.513
- Yeah.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.608
So it's just all about the drive--

00:10:14.608 --> 00:10:16.300
- That made sense to you, right?

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.393
- Yeah, 100%.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.650
- It's a lot of work, bro.

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:24.230
I've been making content
every single day hard

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.903
since February 2009.

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:33.300
And that was after I fuckin'
worked 15 hours a day

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:38.141
being an entrepreneur
in a store for 11 years.

00:10:38.141 --> 00:10:43.141
And that was after
really being in business

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.500
for 8 years doing baseball cards

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:48.700
and making 3, 4000, $2000 a weekend

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:51.103
selling cards as a kid
and having that skill.

00:10:51.103 --> 00:10:55.010
And that was after seven years

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:58.130
of being seven to 14 doing things like

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.090
washing cars, shoveling driveways,

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.320
singing Christmas carols for $1.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:05.720
Starting a mini flea
market, a mini golf course

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.670
in my friend Robbie Turnick's backyard.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:10.963
You know, hustling.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:16.193
This is fuckin' 37 years
of work in the making.

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:21.203
37 years going hard, not kind of.

00:11:22.815 --> 00:11:23.810
You know?

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.560
Think about how hard you work
at the grocery store 40 hours,

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:28.403
that was three days of my workweek.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.150
Like, hard, hard, hard.

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:33.983
- I feel you.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.928
On top of that, I get up
at three in the morning

00:11:36.928 --> 00:11:38.980
to work at the grocery store

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:40.470
and then once I'm done after that,

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:41.980
I'm working on my karate school.

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:44.503
- That's hard, I'm impressed.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:48.665
Start putting videos on YouTube for sure.

00:11:48.665 --> 00:11:51.403
I think TikTok is the fuckin'
golden goose right now.

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:53.690
I would make two TikToks a day

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.540
about your karate stuff, it
will work, you'll be shocked.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:00.770
- Sounds good.

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:01.603
- Awesome, brother.

00:12:01.603 --> 00:12:03.150
Talk to you.
- Awesome, thank you Gary.

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:03.983
- Take care.

